--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADDITIONAL PROJECT NOTE (ZestCo Architecture)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ZestCo is a production-ready, full-stack real-time grocery delivery solution 
integrating multi-threaded communication systems (Socket.io) for live delivery 
tracking, asynchronous messaging channels for user-driver live chats, and secure 
financial gateways (Stripe API) for automated payment processing. 

Any production deployment or commercial fork of this codebase must ensure compliance 
with third-party API terms of service, including secure handling of live WebSocket 
connections and encryption of financial telemetry data.
